   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Temp Personnel Skopje</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tillf. personal Skopje</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Temporary peronnel support from the Swedish Embassy in Sarajevo (ZlataGafic) to Sida&apos;s office in Skopje. The purpose is to assist the staff at the Skopje office during the initial phase with knowledge about theregion and networking. The project will last 24 days and is expected to end on October 18, 1999.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tillf&#xe4;llig placering av Zlata Gafic fr&#xe5;n ambassaden i Sarajevo, p&#xe5; Sidas kontor i Skopje. Syftet &#xe4;r att assistera personalen p&#xe5; Sida- kontoret under en f&#xf6;rsta inledningsfas med regionkunskap och n&#xe4;tverk. Insatsen ber&#xe4;knas p&#xe5;g&#xe5; under 24 dagar och avslutas den 18 oktober 1999</narrative>
  </description>
